1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:07,500
Nobody tells you this about money.

2
00:00:07,500 --> 00:00:15,000
Why poor people stay poor is rarely about income alone.

3
00:00:15,000 --> 00:00:22,500
It feels like running hard but standing still.

4
00:00:22,500 --> 00:00:30,000
Bills grow.

5
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:37,500
Confidence shrinks.

6
00:00:37,500 --> 00:00:45,000
Most people copy emergency behavior as a lifestyle.

7
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,500
Real progress starts when spending becomes intentional and identity-driven.

8
00:00:52,500 --> 00:01:00,000
Use discipline today: track one leak, cut one impulse, and redirect one dollar toward your future self.
